{"key":"i05-s0047","rationale":"Idea:\nThis architectural evolution primarily focuses on enhancing the ","callouts":{"1":"Linear ShortConv: the q/k/v short convolutions no longer apply SiLU, so after each spiking projection the only non-linearity left before the delta rule is the spiking neuron itself (plus L2 norm on q, k).","2":"Spiking q/k/v: an extra LIF neuron after each (linear) ShortConv turns q, k and v into binary spike tensors, so the delta-rule state is written and read with spikes (k, q are L2-normalised in the core; v is only scaled by β).","3":"Extra MLP neuron: a standalone LIF spikes the fc1 output before fc2, whose own neuron then re-thresholds an input that is already binary."},"notes":[],"meta":"Iteration 5 · sample 47  ·  DeltaNet state update  ·  unstable run","nodes":{"n1":{"label":"RMSNorm","code":"L349-L350","tip":null},"q":{"label":"q proj","code":"L209","tip":null},"k":{"label":"k proj","code":"L210","tip":null},"v":{"label":"v proj","code":"L211","tip":null},"bp":{"label":"β proj","code":"L252","tip":null},"cq":{"label":"ShortConv","code":"L223","tip":null,"novel":1},"ck":{"label":"ShortConv","code":"L224","tip":null,"novel":1},"cv":{"label":"ShortConv","code":"L225","tip":null,"novel":1},"pq":{"label":"LIF","code":"L228","tip":null,"novel":2},"pk":{"label":"LIF","code":"L229","tip":null,"novel":2},"pv":{"label":"LIF","code":"L230","tip":null,"novel":2},"l2q":{"label":"L2 norm","code":"L74-L75","tip":null},"l2k":{"label":"L2 norm","code":"L74-L75","tip":null},"core":{"label":"Delta rule","code":"L60-L104","tip":null},"bs":{"label":"σ","code":"L253","tip":null},"onorm":{"label":"RMSNorm","code":"L284","tip":null},"oproj":{"label":"o proj","code":"L289","tip":null},"a1":{"label":"+","code":"L361","tip":null},"n2":{"label":"RMSNorm","code":"L365","tip":null},"fc1":{"label":"fc1","code":"L314","tip":null},"mid":{"label":"LIF","code":"L322","tip":null,"novel":3},"fc2":{"label":"fc2","code":"L326","tip":null},"a2":{"label":"+","code":"L378","tip